{"id":283381747,"title":"1.上篇","summary":"1.TypeScript简介2.为何需要TypeScript","content":"<h1>1.TypeScript简介</h1>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788182620016-cdf62928-adfc-444d-ae1e-d6179c8012f1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>2.为何需要TypeScript</h1>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788182689454-3d7e6163-b0e9-4cd5-8e43-5f153e3aaf19.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788182788904-cc187cb0-12bc-4363-81d3-2b45baf73fd0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788182809949-ecf35064-b0b0-4e51-9b2a-693ec28187bd.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788182872836-5726193d-e075-4196-a95f-e1273344938c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>3.编译TypeScript</h1>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788182931877-1a6b7876-7c8d-42f7-8f9b-7baac1677494.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们要全局安装<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788183078043-004a9caf-ebe6-4183-9023-22726155da8c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788183129818-73e29520-c040-4a4e-8282-08ea30561c83.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788183373554-3ee7fed1-1e6d-40b7-9323-6784f15bccc1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788183168675-249e31fb-efa6-41b7-9263-74903ecbf511.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788183351308-0e571ea9-d710-4f7a-aa9f-0519cf4d5df7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>变量名不写正确就不会生成 js 文件。</p>\n<h1>4.类型声明</h1>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788183546589-b2c972cb-469b-4a8b-9b74-9de6e6bb7cef.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788183523918-84f4dcab-b57b-4e5a-a587-13d8dee4b570.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788183575471-f4a2ab68-4b0f-4efc-b065-4ae317644e8d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788183623607-0dd549f4-fb7f-48bc-a35e-7dec6fc2d73f.png\" alt=\"\">这个b就是字面量类型</p>\n<h1>5.类型推断</h1>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788183718902-0f873f1f-4487-4d17-8e21-2890171465f7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>6.类型总览</h1>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788183753171-766bd531-613b-4006-9053-e4a8393160dd.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788183784254-26b214b9-60af-4057-aa2c-8ffce2dc931f.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788183925394-df9b7f92-930f-447a-9c51-3d8e55773e93.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788183978307-188a8058-cb56-41d0-94f0-a1a318938e15.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788183953621-c860ed16-0fd4-4c39-b549-e532dd0650ac.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788183995728-a61f69cf-ec89-4c76-8e37-3951b895f74c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>7.常用类型</h1>\n<h2>1.any</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788184281484-88b20d5e-7842-4254-ae93-7271e7049622.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788184304910-46452f85-e31b-42d8-9458-92a1aacf99b4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788184269601-c9cc0a07-d2ee-44d7-b6f2-24fb2e8ee30d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>2.unknown</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788184351480-7fa6627b-0a9b-419c-9b8d-59504133cdc0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788184462051-04d588ee-3b32-4870-be9a-0c14fba521ba.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788184473855-b925c148-2f7c-47fb-b30b-e04f744ed7d6.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788184486568-ae91fa93-25a1-476c-9322-58e0ce2c7012.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>unknown点什么都会报错的，因为他是未知的<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788184565148-82dbee39-0cfb-4e55-b5ac-33ddf4cdcfdd.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>3.never</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788185209652-cb4670d3-f718-47be-a644-23c77bf81ab8.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788185222235-36c84f67-9a87-410d-aa7e-28556b70b1f3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>死循环才不会报错</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788185130882-a2dcfce3-8069-444e-9649-85fa39470b49.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>never他是不能有值的，他不能结束或者说不能正常的结束<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788185164969-d4ff82a2-f753-40f1-b112-5225b40a2021.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>4.void</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788185314785-dcd10759-55c7-4484-9d14-1e7900f2b407.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788185464288-d79332fd-ece4-42d5-8361-7cc78f0945cf.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788185579778-4a7580ec-db21-4e47-867c-76c424351aa7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n","contentFormat":"markdown","source":"yuque","cover":"","category_id":82975999,"category":{"id":82975999,"name":"Ts","description":""},"created_at":"2026-08-31T13:21:50.000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-31T14:14:18.000Z","view_count":0,"like_count":0,"is_top":0,"is_featured":0,"tags":[],"status":"published","yuqueUrl":"https://www.yuque.com/woyaoyizhishuidajue/hvdltf/rgg7m9is366lbme5","slug":"rgg7m9is366lbme5","wordCount":119}